]


[arthas@262]$ watch org.apache.ratis.server.impl.RaftConfigurationImpl getLogEntryIndex '{returnObj}'
Press Q or Ctrl+C to abort.
Affect(class count: 1 , method count: 1) cost in 188 ms, listenerId: 6
method=org.apache.ratis.server.impl.RaftConfigurationImpl.getLogEntryIndex location=AtExit
ts=2023-02-13 15:21:03; [cost=0.079311ms] result=@ArrayList[
    @Long[199839671],
]

{code}
"", ""[~liuyaolong], sorry that I forgot you already have the information earlier.

Then, the committedIndex somehow was not updated.  Could you run ""{{group info}}"" command to get the CommitInfos?"", ""[~szetszwo] I use the “group Info” command to get information before, and the result is that the commitIndex of the three ratis servers are all around 1433240， so I guess somehow logEntryIndex was not update."", ""[~liuyaolong], is this still a problem?"", ""hi [~szetszwo] I have not reproduced this problem. I am not sure whether it exists in current version. We can ignore/close this jira for now. If it reproduces in the future, I will add more details."", ""[~liuyaolong] , thanks for the update!  Let's resolve this for now.""]"

