Currently there is no known workaround for this behavior. A workaround will be added here when available","[""Hello! What exactly is required of us in order to expedite this task? Since I see the priority is low. How long does it take you to complete low priority tasks?"", ""Would really need this resolved soon since it renders lots of functionality on our customer portal more or less useless, and it is one of the main functions we provide to our customers."", ""From our side, the technical writer will analyze the details and later, if he finds them, he will report"", ""Hello!

I want to talk a little about what we tried to do to solve the problem:
 - edited the settings of the ""Table of Contents"" tool;

 - removed and re-added ""Table of Contents"";

 - created copies of the page where ""Table of Contents"" was used;

 - created absolutely new pages and added ""Table of Contents"";

 - synchronized the pages where the ""Table of Contents"" is located;

 - replaced ""Table of Contents"" with ""Table of Content Zone"", but this tool could not be configured either.

There are still no changes and the table of contents is not displayed in articles, but this is necessary for users because it was previously convenient to navigate to a specific section in large text.

Hope the problem will be resolved soon.

With respect and gratitude, Arina!:)"", ""Hello! Could you tell me what is the progress in the solution?""]"
